[{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1155:b005:l006","ordinal":164353,"en":"How are you against the champion,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1155:b005:l007","ordinal":164354,"en":"To throw him and win the prize?\""},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1155:b005:l008","ordinal":164355,"en":"Losing his wits,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1155:b005:l009","ordinal":164356,"en":"Zhamgyrchy of the Eshtek"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1155:b005:l010","ordinal":164357,"en":"Fled from among the people:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1155:b005:l011","ordinal":164358,"en":"\"I shall not approach Zholoy,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1155:b005:l012","ordinal":164359,"en":"Nor attack the Kalmyk."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1155:b005:l013","ordinal":164360,"en":"I have given Manas my answer:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1155:b005:l014","ordinal":164361,"en":"I will not go to the Kalmyk"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1155:b005:l015","ordinal":164362,"en":"And die for nothing.\""},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1155:b005:l016","ordinal":164363,"en":"\"Hero Bagysh of the Zhediger!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1155:b005:l017","ordinal":164364,"en":"How are you against the champion—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1155:b005:l018","ordinal":164365,"en":"To win the prize if you throw him,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1155:b005:l019","ordinal":164366,"en":"And be left with nothing if you fall?\""},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1155:b005:l020","ordinal":164367,"en":"Then Bagysh said:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1155:b005:l021","ordinal":164368,"en":"\"I will not go to the Kalmyk;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1155:b005:l022","ordinal":164369,"en":"I will not die needlessly"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1155:b005:l023","ordinal":164370,"en":"At the hands of mighty infidel Zholoy."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1155:b005:l024","ordinal":164371,"en":"I have a land called Zheti-Özön,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1155:b005:l025","ordinal":164372,"en":"And a people called Zhediger."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1155:b005:l026","ordinal":164373,"en":"I made dear Zheti-Özön"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1155:b005:l027","ordinal":164374,"en":"Into a homeland by my own skill;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1155:b005:l028","ordinal":164375,"en":"I made the seven Zhediger clans"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1155:b005:l029","ordinal":164376,"en":"Into a people by my own skill."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1155:b005:l030","ordinal":164377,"en":"I raised a kite into a hunting bird,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1155:b005:l031","ordinal":164378,"en":"Gathered a mixture into a nation;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1155:b005:l032","ordinal":164379,"en":"I trained a wandering bird into a hunting bird,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1155:b005:l033","ordinal":164380,"en":"Gathered wanderers into a nation."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1155:b005:l034","ordinal":164381,"en":"If Zholoy kills me,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1155:b005:l035","ordinal":164382,"en":"The kite will return to its place,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1155:b005:l036","ordinal":164383,"en":"The gathered mixture to its people;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1155:b005:l037","ordinal":164384,"en":"The wandering bird will return to its place,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1155:b005:l038","ordinal":164385,"en":"And the wanderer to his kin."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1155:b005:l039","ordinal":164386,"en":"I will not go to the Kalmyk;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b003:l001","ordinal":164387,"en":"I shall not wrestle and fail to win the prize!\""},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b003:l002","ordinal":164388,"en":"How he lost his wits—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b003:l003","ordinal":164389,"en":"I saw it with my own eyes,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b003:l004","ordinal":164390,"en":"Hero Bagysh of the Zhediger"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b003:l005","ordinal":164391,"en":"Fleeing from among the people."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b003:l006","ordinal":164392,"en":"Growing angry with the khans,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b003:l007","ordinal":164393,"en":"The lion, tiger Manas,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b003:l008","ordinal":164394,"en":"Whipped his steed"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b003:l009","ordinal":164395,"en":"And rode toward Koshoy."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b003:l010","ordinal":164396,"en":"\"My uncle, elder Koshoy,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b003:l011","ordinal":164397,"en":"Saint who has sheltered me!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b003:l012","ordinal":164398,"en":"At the point of death, take one last meal:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b003:l013","ordinal":164399,"en":"Against the black Kalmyk like an ox,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b003:l014","ordinal":164400,"en":"Go down yourself, elder!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b003:l015","ordinal":164401,"en":"They are a host lying in countless ranks;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b003:l016","ordinal":164402,"en":"Among the scattered Muslims,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b003:l017","ordinal":164403,"en":"No one but you"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b003:l018","ordinal":164404,"en":"Is suited for it."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b003:l019","ordinal":164405,"en":"With your beard pure white,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b003:l020","ordinal":164406,"en":"You yourself are fit for the contest."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b003:l021","ordinal":164407,"en":"Uncle, when your journey is near,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b003:l022","ordinal":164408,"en":"Wrestle Zholoy for us;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b003:l023","ordinal":164409,"en":"Win us the great honor, uncle!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b003:l024","ordinal":164410,"en":"Of the towering black Kalmyk,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b003:l025","ordinal":164411,"en":"Go see his full strength, uncle."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b003:l026","ordinal":164412,"en":"Let him seize his former fury;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b003:l027","ordinal":164413,"en":"If he falls into your hands, tear him apart, uncle!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b003:l028","ordinal":164414,"en":"Swing and hook him, uncle;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b003:l029","ordinal":164415,"en":"Seize him from the inside, uncle!\""},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b003:l030","ordinal":164416,"en":"Then Koshoy said:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b003:l031","ordinal":164417,"en":"\"When, grown old, I could not"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b003:l032","ordinal":164418,"en":"Lie in warmth,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b003:l033","ordinal":164419,"en":"When the cuffs of my trousers"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b003:l034","ordinal":164420,"en":"Would not fit my legs,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b003:l035","ordinal":164421,"en":"You met me when I suffered"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b003:l036","ordinal":164422,"en":"The humiliation of eighty-five;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b003:l037","ordinal":164423,"en":"You met me when I had seen"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b003:l038","ordinal":164424,"en":"The far side of life."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b003:l039","ordinal":164425,"en":"I too, my colt Manas—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l001","ordinal":164426,"en":"When drunk from drinking arak,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l002","ordinal":164427,"en":"When young and sound in mind,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l003","ordinal":164428,"en":"When my body was full,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l004","ordinal":164429,"en":"When hellish old age was absent,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l005","ordinal":164430,"en":"When my patterned spear"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l006","ordinal":164431,"en":"Smoked in my hand,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l007","ordinal":164432,"en":"When infidel and Muslim alike"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l008","ordinal":164433,"en":"Jostled before me—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l009","ordinal":164434,"en":"Why did I not die on a mountain pass?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l010","ordinal":164435,"en":"The sprawling city of Beijing—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l011","ordinal":164436,"en":"When I besieged it,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l012","ordinal":164437,"en":"Its kalday and duushu—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l013","ordinal":164438,"en":"When I beat them,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l014","ordinal":164439,"en":"Making their ingots clatter,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l015","ordinal":164440,"en":"When I took them away,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l016","ordinal":164441,"en":"Why did I not die there?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l017","ordinal":164442,"en":"Against darkened Beijing,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l018","ordinal":164443,"en":"When we exchanged blows,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l019","ordinal":164444,"en":"Over Bilerik,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l020","ordinal":164445,"en":"Fighting so many days,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l021","ordinal":164446,"en":"Captive Bilerik—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l022","ordinal":164447,"en":"When I pulled him from his place,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l023","ordinal":164448,"en":"Ezkara, khan of the Manchus—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l024","ordinal":164449,"en":"When I pulled him from his hands,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l025","ordinal":164450,"en":"Why did I not die then?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l026","ordinal":164451,"en":"Eighty-five is an old age;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l027","ordinal":164452,"en":"Your extreme aging"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l028","ordinal":164453,"en":"Is the wrath of the one God."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l029","ordinal":164454,"en":"Go down against the champion yourself, Manas!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l030","ordinal":164455,"en":"When my whole body was sound,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l031","ordinal":164456,"en":"When old age was not upon my head,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l032","ordinal":164457,"en":"Barefoot and bareheaded,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l033","ordinal":164458,"en":"Twenty-five passed by;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l034","ordinal":164459,"en":"Dear time, when the earth trembled!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l035","ordinal":164460,"en":"If my calves were firm as a child's,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l036","ordinal":164461,"en":"If decrepitude were not upon my head,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l037","ordinal":164462,"en":"Would I not grapple with Zholoy?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l038","ordinal":164463,"en":"However much Koshoy refused,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l039","ordinal":164464,"en":"Tiger Manas would not relent."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b003:l001","ordinal":164465,"en":"Koshoy of the Katagan—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b003:l002","ordinal":164466,"en":"He took him out to the champion:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b003:l003","ordinal":164467,"en":"If he won, he would take honor;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b003:l004","ordinal":164468,"en":"If he fell, they would stand watching."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b003:l005","ordinal":164469,"en":"As the tale of the honorable people tells,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b003:l006","ordinal":164470,"en":"Your uncle went out to the champion."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b003:l007","ordinal":164471,"en":"\"Go out yourself, Manas,\" said Koshoy,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b003:l008","ordinal":164472,"en":"Pleading as he stood."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b003:l009","ordinal":164473,"en":"These were Manas's words:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b003:l010","ordinal":164474,"en":"\"When my father Zhakyp pursued,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b003:l011","ordinal":164475,"en":"When my mother Chyiyrdy gave birth,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b003:l012","ordinal":164476,"en":"I grew to maturity and became a man, Koshoy,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b003:l013","ordinal":164477,"en":"And became equal to a hero's son."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b003:l014","ordinal":164478,"en":"Since Manas became Manas,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b003:l015","ordinal":164479,"en":"Since fortune settled upon my head,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b003:l016","ordinal":164480,"en":"Since I mounted a horse astride"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b003:l017","ordinal":164481,"en":"And donned the coat Akolpok,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b003:l018","ordinal":164482,"en":"Many gathered together;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b003:l019","ordinal":164483,"en":"I had no ax for a man on foot."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b003:l020","ordinal":164484,"en":"Once mounted on a horse,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b003:l021","ordinal":164485,"en":"I was more skillful than an intriguer,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b003:l022","ordinal":164486,"en":"Mightier than a brave man."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b003:l023","ordinal":164487,"en":"Send me against a claimant in debate;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b003:l024","ordinal":164488,"en":"Send me against a spear-bearing enemy."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b003:l025","ordinal":164489,"en":"Send me against a foe who closes knee to knee;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b003:l026","ordinal":164490,"en":"Send me against an enemy who draws rein to rein."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b003:l027","ordinal":164491,"en":"If I do not level my spear and thrust,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b003:l028","ordinal":164492,"en":"Then my eyes—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b004:l001","ordinal":164493,"en":"Cast them to the flank where whips are traded;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b004:l002","ordinal":164494,"en":"Cast me into the black-burning fire.\""},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b004:l003","ordinal":164495,"en":"Then Koshoy heeded his words"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b004:l004","ordinal":164496,"en":"And stepped out to the champion."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b004:l005","ordinal":164497,"en":"Speaking many words in a ringing voice,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b004:l006","ordinal":164498,"en":"Your uncle entered into grief:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b004:l007","ordinal":164499,"en":"\"Eighty-five is an age,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b004:l008","ordinal":164500,"en":"The humiliation of a living man."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b004:l009","ordinal":164501,"en":"Rather than live on like a mountain,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b004:l010","ordinal":164502,"en":"It is better for a man to lie in a mound."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b004:l011","ordinal":164503,"en":"Had I met the Kalmyk at sixty,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b004:l012","ordinal":164504,"en":"Would I not have taken him?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b004:l013","ordinal":164505,"en":"Had I met him at seventy,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b004:l014","ordinal":164506,"en":"Would I not have thrown him?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b004:l015","ordinal":164507,"en":"When I speak, I have sorrow and grief;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b004:l016","ordinal":164508,"en":"Magnanimous Manas, hear me."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b004:l017","ordinal":164509,"en":"The hides of forty ibex—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b004:l018","ordinal":164510,"en":"I have my kyldyrama trousers."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b004:l019","ordinal":164511,"en":"When jostling in combat"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b004:l020","ordinal":164512,"en":"With a dog who boasts of strength,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b004:l021","ordinal":164513,"en":"If that enraged pig seizes them,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b004:l022","ordinal":164514,"en":"My trousers will split,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b004:l023","ordinal":164515,"en":"And your uncle's shame will show openly."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b004:l024","ordinal":164516,"en":"His splendor will spill like ashes."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b004:l025","ordinal":164517,"en":"In your uncle's old age,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b004:l026","ordinal":164518,"en":"His face will change from shame;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b004:l027","ordinal":164519,"en":"Because of the sprawling black Kalmyk,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b004:l028","ordinal":164520,"en":"Your uncle will fall.\""},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l001","ordinal":164521,"en":"Koshoy's white beard gleamed;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l002","ordinal":164522,"en":"Your uncle Koshoy spoke loudly"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l003","ordinal":164523,"en":"And stopped as he turned."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l004","ordinal":164524,"en":"Your mighty uncle Koshoy"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l005","ordinal":164525,"en":"Lamented his former days:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l006","ordinal":164526,"en":"\"Hey, Khan Manas, my colt!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l007","ordinal":164527,"en":"When drunk from drinking arak,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l008","ordinal":164528,"en":"When young and light-minded,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l009","ordinal":164529,"en":"Barefoot and bareheaded,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l010","ordinal":164530,"en":"At twenty-five, when the earth trembled,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l011","ordinal":164531,"en":"Dear youth passed away."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l012","ordinal":164532,"en":"Eighty-five is a mighty burden,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l013","ordinal":164533,"en":"The humiliation of a living man."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l014","ordinal":164534,"en":"Rather than live excessively long,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l015","ordinal":164535,"en":"It is better that the Most High God"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l016","ordinal":164536,"en":"Should take what he created."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l017","ordinal":164537,"en":"Once we besieged"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l018","ordinal":164538,"en":"His sprawling city;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l019","ordinal":164539,"en":"Once we beat"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l020","ordinal":164540,"en":"Its kalday and ambal."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l021","ordinal":164541,"en":"When we beat them—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l022","ordinal":164542,"en":"Counting now, that time has passed;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l023","ordinal":164543,"en":"Staggering as with yellow sickness,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l024","ordinal":164544,"en":"Old age has arrived."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l025","ordinal":164545,"en":"My colt, tiger Manas,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l026","ordinal":164546,"en":"My joints have loosened,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l027","ordinal":164547,"en":"My eyes glint with pus,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l028","ordinal":164548,"en":"My waist has stooped downward;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l029","ordinal":164549,"en":"Bastard old age"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l030","ordinal":164550,"en":"Has mounted me with jutting laziness."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l031","ordinal":164551,"en":"All my joints creak;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l032","ordinal":164552,"en":"In the whiteness of my beard,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l033","ordinal":164553,"en":"You have laid a burden upon me, Manas,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l034","ordinal":164554,"en":"Saying, 'Wrestle this infidel.'"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l035","ordinal":164555,"en":"When my journey is near,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l036","ordinal":164556,"en":"My eyes stare dimly,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l037","ordinal":164557,"en":"And my joints tremble."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l001","ordinal":164558,"en":"When I speak, Manas, I have grief:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l002","ordinal":164559,"en":"The hides of forty wild asses,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l003","ordinal":164560,"en":"Joined together and made—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l004","ordinal":164561,"en":"I have kyldyrama trousers."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l005","ordinal":164562,"en":"Great Zholoy of the Kalmyks—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l006","ordinal":164563,"en":"If I wrestle him, they will split,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l007","ordinal":164564,"en":"And before the people,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l008","ordinal":164565,"en":"Your uncle's nakedness will show."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l009","ordinal":164566,"en":"The honor of your elder Koshoy"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l010","ordinal":164567,"en":"Will spill like ashes."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l011","ordinal":164568,"en":"His cry will reach God;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l012","ordinal":164569,"en":"Your poor uncle will fall."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l013","ordinal":164570,"en":"Will he not see the onlookers?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l014","ordinal":164571,"en":"If my shame appears,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l015","ordinal":164572,"en":"Will your uncle not die before his time?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l016","ordinal":164573,"en":"Will the Kalmyk not split my trousers?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l017","ordinal":164574,"en":"Driven beyond all means,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l018","ordinal":164575,"en":"Will your uncle not die before his time?!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l019","ordinal":164576,"en":"Zholoy of the Kalmyks—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l020","ordinal":164577,"en":"Looking at him, he is a huge giant;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l021","ordinal":164578,"en":"Among the black Kalmyk people,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l022","ordinal":164579,"en":"That bastard is their master."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l023","ordinal":164580,"en":"Thick-wristed and stone-hearted,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l024","ordinal":164581,"en":"Such is Zholoy's nature."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l025","ordinal":164582,"en":"The broad-limbed brute"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l026","ordinal":164583,"en":"My worthless trousers—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l027","ordinal":164584,"en":"Will he not seize them by their cuffs,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l028","ordinal":164585,"en":"Tear all my trousers,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l029","ordinal":164586,"en":"And before the people"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l030","ordinal":164587,"en":"Leave your uncle like carrion."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l031","ordinal":164588,"en":"Will he not see the infidel's strength?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l032","ordinal":164589,"en":"If they grapple, will he not split the trousers?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l033","ordinal":164590,"en":"Your uncle, the people's lament,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l034","ordinal":164591,"en":"Will he not die before his time?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l035","ordinal":164592,"en":"The black Kalmyk and Manchu people"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l036","ordinal":164593,"en":"Have surely gathered."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l037","ordinal":164594,"en":"Kökötöy's many prizes—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b003:l001","ordinal":164595,"en":"Would the Kalmyks not take them and return?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b003:l002","ordinal":164596,"en":"Would the Muslims' pride not be broken?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b003:l003","ordinal":164597,"en":"Would the Black Kalmyks and Manchus not say,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b003:l004","ordinal":164598,"en":"“We have thrown down their khan,”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b003:l005","ordinal":164599,"en":"And would God not utterly strike us?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b003:l006","ordinal":164600,"en":"Before the lumbering Joloy,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b003:l007","ordinal":164601,"en":"I have no trousers on my backside;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b003:l008","ordinal":164602,"en":"How can I go to him with them bristling bare?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b003:l009","ordinal":164603,"en":"Before that hulking Black Kalmyk,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b003:l010","ordinal":164604,"en":"How can I grapple body to body?”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b003:l011","ordinal":164605,"en":"Your dear elder, Khan Koshoi,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b003:l012","ordinal":164606,"en":"Made his meaning known in all these words,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b003:l013","ordinal":164607,"en":"And then your elder Khan Koshoi stood there."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b003:l014","ordinal":164608,"en":"Koshoi of the Katagan"}]
